/fighting-in-ethiopia-and-the-risk-of-regional-spillover/'}, {'signal_id': '96067be01a3925c0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Establishing Battery Supply Chain Resilience for Drones <p>Militaries have spent more than a century operating with fuel and ammunition as limits of combat endurance. They are only beginning to treat batteries with the same operational seriousness, as small unmanned systems move ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/establishing-battery-supply-chain-resilience-for-drones/'}, {'signal_id': '46c8ac1798543095', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Tehran is a Different Beast Now <p>The Tehran that the world knew is gone. It died in the fires with former Supreme Leader Ali Khamenei on the first day of the war in February. His son and new Supreme Leader, Mojtaba Khamenei &#8212; wherever he is and in whatever physical condit', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/tehran-is-a-different-beast-now/'}, {'signal_id': '20959e0f322e0b35', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Reading Pyongyang Through the Cracks of the International System <p>In 2023, three North Korea analysts identified what they believe most people studying the country get wrong, and how analysts can avoid those traps. Three years later, we asked them to revisit their arguments and', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/reading-pyongyang-through-the-cracks-of-the-international-system/'}, {'signal_id': '6b33ec26d149c8cf', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Guns, Growth, and the German Reinvention of Military Keynesianism <p>In March 2025, Germany did more than loosen a fiscal rule. It fused two national emergencies &#8212; a deteriorating European security order and a deteriorating industrial model &#8212; into a single constitutio', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/guns-growth-and-the-german-reinvention-of-military-keynesianism/'}, {'signal_id': '42dd74dd00ec1072', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'In Skepticism We Trus