212956b', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "Biden says he wouldn't have run in 2024 if he knew about his cancer The former president also called his debate performance “not very consequential” in an interview with People magazine. <p>Former President Joe Biden would not have run for reelection in 2024 if he had known about", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/11/biden-2024-cancer-diagnosis-debate-performance-01160750'}, {'signal_id': '9f1e6962ce0baa26', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Several Dem women leaned into their identity this cycle. Not in the way you think. They focused less on the historic nature of their bids and more on parenting in a tough economy. <p>When Annie Andrews announced her longshot campaign for U.S. Senate last May, the Democrat from So', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/11/welcome-to-the-year-of-the-mom-01160441'}, {'signal_id': 'da49644f8a8f858b', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Business leaders and Washington prepare for a Democratic Congress <h3 class="title">Business leaders and Washington prepare for a Democratic Congress</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/980c5b3e-6c90-433f-a0ff-7275d25e3dc8/d427ab31', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/11/business-leaders-and-washington-prepare-for-a-democratic-congress-2227260'}, {'signal_id': '684ccbbe8b95d4a2', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Wes Moore wants immigration reform. Can he work with Stephen Miller? The possible 2028 contender told POLITICO that Democrats should try to work with the president’s new chief of staff despite a “well of distrust.” Gov. Wes Moore on Stephen Miller: ‘I will work with anybody, I wi', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/10/gov-wes-moore-sees-an-opportunity-to-work-with-stephen-miller-01158571'}, {'signal_id': '21b0b6bcee1656f4', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Democrats plot their course on national popular vote Democrats have won unified control of enough swing states — Pennsylvania, Wisconsin, and Michigan — to sidestep the Electoral College. Will they back the effort? <p>Democrats who just triumphed in a number of battlegrounds are ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/10/democrats-national-popular-vote-electoral-college-2028-wisconsin-michigan-pennsylvania-01158164'}, {'signal_id': 'dc02eb03eea31ae4', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'A new set of Democratic power brokers just dropped before 2028 Presidential hopefuls are already working the phones to build relationships with the new slate of Democratic figures in key early states. <p>The 2028 presidential race is already playing out in the text threads and ph', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/10/new-democratic-leaders-2028-elections-01157824'}, {'signal_id': 'c2cbccfb3cc8d664', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The Democratic Party’s new 2028 powerbrokers <h3 class="title">The Democratic Party’s new 2028 powerbrokers</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/fe0fea9f-6a6d-416f-bdec-14aa1c75d330/c3ab8662-9b8c-440f-8e9b-b1a22828dc5c/1280x720/matc', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/10/the-democratic-partys-new-2028-powerbrokers-2224931'}, {'signal_id': 'a91a3e8f35e19cba', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Court filing alleges Trump adviser received cash, luxury gifts from foreign interests The filing from Alex Bruesewitz’s ex-business partner Derek Utley is a response to an earlier lawsuit claiming Utley embezzled millions from their firm, X Strategies. <p>A former business partne', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/09/lawsuit-alex-bruesewitz-foreign-entities-derek-utley-01157561'}, {'signal_id': '4531529c3de93902', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Josh Shapiro says Texas won’t replace Pennsylvania as the ‘ultimate swing state’ The governor romped to a 22-point reelection victory last week. <p>Democrats’ blue wave blew up the 2028 battle map. But Josh Shapiro insists Texas isn’t going to replace Pennsylvania as the “ultimat', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/09/josh-shapiro-pennsylvania-2028-texas-01156246'}, {'signal_id': 'e95fdabb3ced8873', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The Bloc wants a bold agenda. Can Jeffries deliver? <h3 class="title">The Bloc wants a bold agenda. Can Jeffries deliver?</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/40f53338-b958-416d-ac86-b170036698fa/01cea32e-f455-46c9-93b0-ae7b5068e75a', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/09/the-bloc-wants-a-bold-agenda-can-jeffries-deliver-2224165'}, {'signal_id': '73f77c37c3776582', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': '‘Old ideas are for old people’: A new MAGA group looks to push GOP further right American Ascent promises to recruit and elect a new generation of young ‘America First’ candidates. <p>A new Republican group thinks their party is too old, too moderate and too weak. So they’re laun', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/09/jd-vance-allies-launch-new-group-01155638'}, {'signal_id': '2a25e5e82a01aa3f', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'How Hinojosa’s win in Texas could bite Beshear Latino operatives for months pressured Andy Beshear and the Democratic Governors Association to back Gina Hinojosa. Now her win is blowing back on them. <p>AUSTIN, Texas — Gina Hinojosa’s stunning victory put Texas at the epicenter o', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/08/texas-hinojosa-beshear-2028-01155434'}, {'signal_id': 'c4a37aaba6a7065f', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Democratic thrashing redraws the map of state power Dems picked up more than 500 seats (and counting) and flipped at least 12 legislative chambers. <p>The blue wave crashed through statehouses across the country Tuesday — carrying political and policy ramifications that will reve', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/08/democratic-thrashing-redraws-the-map-of-state-power-01154607'}, {'signal_id': '90deec3a6ba875c8', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Why this GOP governor thinks his party got ‘worse than a butt whipping’ on Tuesday Oklahoma Gov. Kevin Stitt blamed the lack of ‘civility’ from President Trump as a reason Republicans got shellacked. <p>Kevin Stitt, the outgoing Republican governor of Oklahoma, has a message for ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/07/kevin-stitt-republicans-butt-whipping-be-nice-01155140'}, {'signal_id': '0212e6d5f7037782', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "Inside the early GOP reckoning after historic defeat Stephen Miller's rise to chief of staff exacerbated GOP fears that there will be no party-wide reckoning after their midterm wipeout. <p>President Donald Trump's decision to name hard-line loyalist Stephen Miller as his top aid", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/06/gop-reckoning-trump-midterms-stephen-miller-01154760'}, {'signal_id': '900e513f64da27db', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The size of Democrats’ wave surprised even their top House super PAC House Majority PAC President Mike Smith said Democrats’ gains are “on the very high end” of the group’s expectations. <p>Even the head of House Democrats’ top super PAC didn’t fully anticipate the size of their ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/06/democratic-blue-wave-surprised-house-leader-01153548'}, {'signal_id': 'ba0bc6ab35b8216c', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The Clyburn test <h3 class="title">The Clyburn test</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/df613658-3ed5-495b-98a3-4720dfb23083/8e6ba179-ba26-4f7a-8d33-8fe89d273148/1280x720/match/image.jpg" />lead image</p>', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/06/the-clyburn-test-2222220'}, {'signal_id': '8c0fa235271d063c', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The nation’s cartoonists on the week in politics Every week political cartoonists throughout the country and across the political spectrum apply their ink-stained skills to capture the foibles, memes, hypocrisies and other head-slapping events in the world of politics. The fruits', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/gallery/2026/11/06/the-nations-cartoonists-on-the-week-in-politics-01153224'}, {'signal_id': '4162865c2fce388b', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The midterms blew open the 2028 map. Republicans are panicking. Strategists on both sides agree: Ohio, Texas and Iowa should be competitive in 2028. <p>Brutal red-state losses are raising alarm among Republicans about the 2028 presidential battlefield.</p><p>Democrats’ midterm bl', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/06/midterms-2028-presidential-map-republicans-panic-texas-ohio-iowa-01153026'}, {'signal_id': '2cbd6bab3c14afd5', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Poll: Republicans split on whether they’re split POLITICO’s polling before Election Day showed that both parties would be left without clear direction amid a blue wave. And then the blue wave hit. <p>Tuesday’s blue wave didn’t resolve either party’s internal divides. In fact, The', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/06/poll-republicans-democrats-divided-elections-01152054'}, {'signal_id': 'eed6aa2cd8308b50', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Jim Clyburn gives his reaction to Dems’ historic midterm win <h3 class="title">Jim Clyburn gives his reaction to Dems’ historic midterm win</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/1426fdc1-a00c-4b46-bade-be686c449208/16589cd1-56ef-4ba0', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/05/jim-clyburn-gives-his-reaction-to-dems-historic-midterm-win-2221728'}, {'signal_id': '1fd3f852a5267095', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'How Abdul El-Sayed actually did with Jewish voters Yes, he ran behind. In an interview, the senator-elect acknowledged Israel was a source of disagreement, but said he’s not changing his position. <p>Abdul El-Sayed ran well behind other Michigan Democrats in places with more Jewi', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/05/abdul-el-sayed-jewish-voters-interview-01152872'}, {'signal_id': '81e40417bea92922', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Bernie Sanders lost the fight in 2016. A decade later, he won the war. Bernie Sanders’ focus on economic populism once faced criticism within the party. Now it’s winning in Michigan, Texas, Montana and Wisconsin. <p>In 2016, two populist revolutions threatened to remake American ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/05/bernie-sanders-midterms-2028-01151185'}, {'signal_id': 'be96f3b8e57e007e', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Bernie’s populist moment <h3 class="title">Bernie’s populist moment</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/63af4ef4-47e4-495a-a1e7-e7cdeeafac82/45c2cbf2-bc07-4059-a22b-0ba1ac4f03e6/1280x720/match/image.jpg" />lead image</p>', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/05/bernies-populist-moment-2221173'}, {'signal_id': '44a9e41aadfc8361', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': '‘This is an earthquake’: Latino voters rush back to Democrats The Latino inroads Trump made over the last decade have been completely reversed <p>AUSTIN — Texas. Florida. Pennsylvania. Colorado. Arizona. Nevada. California.</p> \n<p>The historic landslide of Latino voters toward D', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/04/this-is-an-earthquake-latino-voters-rush-back-to-democrats-01149510'}, {'signal_id': 'f655a438298e3e7e', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "Democrats sweep Texas Republicans ran the country's second most-populous state for 30 years. Tonight Democrats took it back. <p>AUSTIN — Democrats’ vision of a blue Texas is finally here.</p><p>James Talarico has been elected a U.S. senator and Gina Hinojosa as governor, the firs", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/03/democrats-sweep-texas-01147637'}, {'signal_id': '527afc153fccfb72', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Voters pummel GOP out of power Republicans accepted what is on track to be a historic midterm defeat — a long-feared “blue wave” washing across the nation. <p>Voters have forcefully rejected President Donald Trump and Republicans, electing Democrats in GOP strongholds nationwide ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/03/midterms-blue-wave-gop-wipeout-01147461'}, {'signal_id': '16c3ea54eca09a33', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Biden’s revenge: His alumni are winning in the midterms The former president wasn’t a prominent force on the trail, but some of his one-time staffers have won high profile races on Tuesday night. <p>Joe Biden was unceremoniously ushered out of the White House two years ago.</p><p', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/03/lance-bottoms-biden-alumni-midterm-election-wins-01147330'}, {'signal_id': 'ab6e2455f22ec29e', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Poll: GOP voters say the party isn’t focused enough on the economy Hours before polls close, a new survey shows a stark disconnect between what Republican voters want their party to focus on and what they say the party actually is focusing on. <p>Republicans don’t think their par', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/03/poll-gop-voters-economy-midterms-01145083'}], 'source_metadata': [{'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 100, 'first_seen': '2026-11-11T08:30:24+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-09-17T18:15:01+00:00'}, {'source': 'cipher_brief', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 30, 'first_seen': '2026-11-11T14:13:58+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-10-19T12:39:08+00:00'}, {'source': 'just_security', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 10, 'first_seen': '2026-11-11T14:29:34+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-11-10T13:50:22+00:00'}, {'source': 'rand', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 20, 'first_seen': '2026-11-09T16:45:00+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-09-08T07:00:00+00:00'}, {'source': 'atlantic_